enter | Henrietta NY","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Town page lists Tuesday–Saturday hours, 9 a.m.–4 p.m., with last admission at 3:45 p.m.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"tinker-homestead-farm-museum-calkins-road","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Tinker Homestead & Farm Museum","title":"Tinker Homestead for the cobblestone farm museum","subtitle":"Calkins Road corridor at Tinker Nature Park","notes":"Call ahead to arrange a tour, then focus on the restored homestead and farm implements that interpret regional agricultural change.","short_summary":"A restored 1830 cobblestone homestead and farm museum.","evidence_claim":"The Tinker Homestead & Farm Museum includes an 1830 cobblestone farm and displays farm implements; tours are available by appointment.","source_url":"https://www.henriettany.gov/community/page/tinker-homestead-farm-museum","source_title":"Tinker Homestead & Farm Museum | Henrietta NY","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Tours are listed by appointment Tuesday–Saturday, 10 a.m.–2 p.m.; call before visiting.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lookup-park-east-henrietta-road","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Lookup Park","title":"Lookup Park for disc golf and the dog park","subtitle":"East Henrietta Road corridor","notes":"Bring the gear appropriate to your plan: the town’s park listing identifies both a short disc-golf course and a dog park here.","short_summary":"A town park with short disc golf, dog-park, and driving-range amenities.","evidence_claim":"Lookup Park at 3850 East Henrietta Road is listed with a dog park, a short disc-golf course, and a golf driving range.","source_url":"https://www.henriettany.gov/parksites","source